      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate bilingual veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently commend Dr. Ramirez, Dr. Mariangel, Dr. Adriana, and technicians such as Rosie and Dayani for their kindness and thorough explanations. Clients appreciate that the staff communicates comfortably in both English and Spanish throughout exams. While several reviewers complained about phone interactions and front-desk billing policies, most visitors describe a warm and caring team."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Patient care for rescue pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the gentle bedside manner shown to dogs, cats, and rescue animals brought in for medical evaluations. Clients note that staff take time to cuddle and comfort nervous pets to keep them calm during procedures. Several pet parents highlight that older animals with chronic issues receive thoughtful and stress-free handling."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Reliable wellness and emergency procedures"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report positive medical results for diverse visits on Bird Road, including successful emergency toenail removals, puppy vaccinations, and life-saving treatments for older dogs. Pet owners appreciate thorough follow-through on diagnostic tests and post-treatment guidance. Most reviewers feel confident in the medical outcomes their animals receive."
      }
    }
  ],
